#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:12
msgid ""
"clangd is an LLVM/Clang-based C/C++ language server that understands "
"UniSDK's complex macro definitions and configuration system, providing:"
msgstr ""
"clangd 是一个基于 LLVM/Clang 的 C/C++ 语言服务器，能够理解 UniSDK 的复杂宏定义和配置系统，提供："

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:14
msgid "Intelligent code completion"
msgstr "智能代码补全"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:15
msgid "Go to definition"
msgstr "跳转到定义"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:16
msgid "Find references"
msgstr "查找引用"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:17
msgid "Semantic highlighting"
msgstr "语义高亮"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:18
msgid "Code navigation"
msgstr "代码导航"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:19
msgid "Inline diagnostics"
msgstr "内联诊断"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:20
msgid "Rename refactoring"
msgstr "重命名重构"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:22
msgid "Why Choose clangd?"
msgstr "为什么选择 clangd？"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:24
msgid ""
"UniSDK makes extensive use of Kconfig-generated configuration macros "
"(`autoconf.h`, `capabilities.h`) and cross-compilation. Ordinary syntax "
"highlighting cannot correctly parse these macros, leading to false error "
"reports and navigation failures. clangd solves this problem by reading "
"`compile_commands.json`."
msgstr ""
"UniSDK 大量使用 Kconfig 生成的配置宏（`autoconf.h`、`capabilities.h`）和交叉编译。普通语法高亮无法正确解析这些宏，会导致错误误报和导航失败。clangd 通过读取 `compile_commands.json` 解决了这个问题。"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:26
msgid "Installation Steps"
msgstr "安装步骤"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:28
msgid ""
"Install **clangd** (publisher: LLVM) from the VS Code extension "
"marketplace"
msgstr "从 VS Code 扩展市场安装 **clangd**（发布者：LLVM）"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:29
msgid "Disable the Microsoft C/C++ IntelliSense engine to avoid conflicts:"
msgstr "禁用 Microsoft C/C++ IntelliSense 引擎以避免冲突："

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:30
msgid ""
"`Ctrl+Shift+P` → `Preferences: Open Settings (UI)` → Extensions → C/C++ →"
" IntelliSense"
msgstr ""
"`Ctrl+Shift+P` → `Preferences: Open Settings (UI)` → Extensions → C/C++ → IntelliSense"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:31
msgid "Set `IntelliSenseEngine` to `disabled`"
msgstr "将 `IntelliSenseEngine` 设置为 `disabled`"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:33
msgid "Key Files"
msgstr "关键文件"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:35
msgid "**`compile_commands.json`**"
msgstr "**`compile_commands.json`**"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:37
msgid ""
"Automatically generated in the `build/` directory by CMake during the "
"build. clangd reads this file to understand the project's compilation "
"options."
msgstr ""
"由 CMake 在构建过程中自动生成在 `build/` 目录中。clangd 读取此文件以了解项目的编译选项。"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:49
msgid "**`.clangd`** (Optional configuration at project root)"
msgstr "**`.clangd`**（项目根目录的可选配置文件）"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:62
msgid "Common Issues"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:64
msgid "**Files Display Incorrectly After Switching to a Different Chip**"
msgstr "**切换到不同芯片后文件显示错误**"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:66
msgid ""
"clangd provides semantic analysis based on the current build's "
"`compile_commands.json`. If the project was previously built for TL321X, "
"files for TL721X will not be correctly parsed."
msgstr ""
"clangd 基于当前构建的 `compile_commands.json` 提供语义分析。如果项目之前是为 TL321X 构建的，则 TL721X 的文件将无法被正确解析。"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:68
msgid "**Solution**: Rebuild the project with the target chip."
msgstr "**解决方法**：使用目标芯片重新构建项目。"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:70
msgid "**Warnings Still Present After a Recent Rebuild**"
msgstr "**重新构建后仍显示警告**"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:72
msgid "File indexing happens lazily and needs a manual trigger to update."
msgstr "文件索引是延迟执行的，需要手动触发更新。"

#: ../../source/developing/ide_integration.md:74
msgid "**Solution**: Edit and save the target file to force an update."
msgstr "**解决方法**：编辑并保存目标文件以强制更新。"

